cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GenoCortex or the Fractal Predictive Cortex, please cite it."
title: "GenoCortex: the Fractal Predictive Cortex (FPC)"
abstract: >-
  A training-free, alignment-free, self-organising model for biological
  sequences that unifies prediction, anomaly detection, classification, and
  phylogenetics from a single surprise-minimisation objective, by growing
  predictive prototypes in Chaos Game Representation space where the model is
  most surprised. Pure NumPy/SciPy core; runs offline.
type: software
